OL,3,GNEWSAPrayers at vigil for nurse missing
OL,4,Ain Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrayers have been said at a vigil in
OL,7,FKent for a nurse who went missing in
OL,8,Fthe flash floods in Nepal.
OL,10,FSarada Simkhada, a senior nurse at
OL,11,FDarent Valley Hospital in Dartford, was
OL,12,Fon a pilgrimage to Mount Kailash when
OL,13,Fthe floods hit on 26 August, leaving at
OL,14,Fleast 1,200 dead and thousands missing.
OL,16,FSimkhada is one of 33 British nationals
OL,17,Funaccounted for, many of whose families
OL,18,Fhave flown out to the country's Tibetan
OL,19,Fborder to help in the ongoing search
OL,20,Ffor survivors.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
