OL,3,GNEWSAPrayers at vigil for nurse missing
OL,4,Ain Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer brother, Shambhu, said that her
OL,7,Ffamily was desperately waiting for news
OL,8,Fthat she was alive and implored her to
OL,9,F"please stay strong, wherever you are."
